CTAD

Since C++17 constructors can deduce the templates parameters types allowing us to do things such as:

```cpp

std::vector<int> v{0,1,2}; // instead we can do

std::vector v{0, 1, 2}; // the compile can just deduce the type itself

std::array a{1,2,3}; // compiler will just look at tihs and go oh its a std::array<int, 3>

```
